description:
In order to work in Ireland a non-EEA National, unless they are exempted, must hold a valid employment permit.  Please review the Eligibility and requirements for an employment permit if you are unsure of your eligibility to apply for this vacancy. <br>  The successful candidate will be required to:
- Combine creative design, technical production, and digital marketing strategy to promote our business;
- Collect and interpret data from advertising campaigns and consumer behavior to help our company improve its marketing ROI and strategy;
- Create and plan internet content in line with the overall strategy;
- Coordination and execution of marketing campaigns and content creation;
- Create content calendars;
- Collect, manage and analyze market data to track and identify market trends;
- Data analysis and reports for all projects related to marketing, as well as monitoring sales and marketing performance metrics.


Minimum experience required in marketing: 2 Years.
